cerate docker image of EUREKA

POM.XML-
<!--generate jar with name eks-eureka-->
<finalName>eks-eureka</finalName>

1. generate jar -maven install
2. create docker file in the same directory as pom.xml
•	FROM <JDK version>
ADD target/<jarname>.jar <jarname>.jar
EXPOSE 8080(port where container run the docker image)
ENTRYPOINT ["java", "-jar", "<jarname>.jar"] //command to execute the kjar
eg,
FROM openjdk:24
ADD target/eks-eureka.jar eks-eureka.jar
EXPOSE 8080
ENTRYPOINT ["java", "-jar", "eks-eureka.jar"]

change jdk 24 to eclipse-temurin:24-jre as jdk 24 is not available in docker hub



3.rub below command in terminal to create docker image
docker build -t <image name>:<tag> .
eg. docker build -t eks-eureka .
